    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick and play any level! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful soundtrack! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 types of subgames! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make gameplay easier with the Hint funtion! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holiday cheer galore!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Collector's Edition</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 extra levels </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Player </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wallpapers</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All I Want for Christmas are Subgames whisks you off on a magical journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This festive Christmas extravaganza brings a sleigh-load of merry subgames, including Find the Difference tasks that'll captivate you, cozy Jigsaw puzzles to complete, and joyful Paint sessions for crafting holiday masterpieces. Engage your brain with cheery Crossword riddles, test your memory with snowman pairs in the Memory game, and challenge your wordplay with festive Word Guess tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646500/extras/12e6a29c2f07d3eb87d1b597b34478f3.poster.avif?t=1729643458\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646500/extras/12e6a29c2f07d3eb87d1b597b34478f3.webm?t=1729643458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646500/extras/12e6a29c2f07d3eb87d1b597b34478f3.mp4?t=1729643458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait, there's more! With over 20 types 